1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,382
Ava: If your training job hangs across GPUs, PyTorch 2.15 changes both the default communication backend and how you investigate the hang.
Ava：如果训练任务在多个 GPU 上卡住，PyTorch 2.15 改变了默认通信后端，也改变了排查卡顿的方式。

2
00:00:10,382 --> 00:00:15,691
Brian: It also brings changes for low-precision decode and several GPU platforms.
Brian：它还改进了低精度解码，并更新了对多个 GPU 平台的支持。

3
00:00:15,691 --> 00:00:24,076
Let's start with distributed training, because the NCCL switch can affect an existing job without a code change.
先说分布式训练，因为 NCCL 后端的切换无需改代码就可能影响现有任务。

4
00:00:24,076 --> 00:00:27,404
Ava: A single stalled GPU can stop a whole run.
Ava：一块 GPU 卡住，就可能让整个训练任务停摆。

5
00:00:27,404 --> 00:00:32,826
If a collective hangs, what can I see now about the other ranks?
如果集合通信卡住，现在能看到其他 rank 在做什么吗？

6
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:38,710
Brian: A backend-agnostic flight recorder writes a post-mortem to disk when a collective hangs.
Brian：与后端无关的飞行记录器会在集合通信卡住时，将事后诊断信息写入磁盘。

7
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:45,263
Watchdog health reaches the debug server, so a timeout on any rank triggers dumps from every rank.
看门狗的健康状态会传到调试服务器，因此任一 rank 超时都会触发所有 rank 导出诊断信息。

8
00:00:45,263 --> 00:00:50,360
Those dumps capture what each rank was doing at the moment of the hang.
这些信息记录了卡住时每个 rank 正在做什么。

9
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:55,737
Ava: I also noticed that communicators are created with the process group.
Ava：我还注意到，通信器现在会随进程组一起创建。

10
00:00:55,737 --> 00:01:05,010
Reconfiguration can opt into a shrink/grow fast path with NCCL 2.29 or newer, so surviving ranks skip a full bootstrap.
使用 NCCL 2.29 或更新版本时，重配置可启用缩减或扩容的快速路径，让存活的 rank 跳过完整的初始化流程。

11
00:01:05,010 --> 00:01:09,958
How can a team roll back if the new default causes trouble?
如果新默认设置出了问题，团队怎么回退？

12
00:01:09,958 --> 00:01:15,493
Brian: Set TORCH_DIST_USE_NCCL2=0 or select nccl-legacy.
Brian：设置 TORCH_DIST_USE_NCCL2=0，或选择 nccl-legacy。

13
00:01:15,493 --> 00:01:26,564
The rewritten backend was opt-in in PyTorch 2.14; now every nccl process group uses it by default.
重写后的后端在 PyTorch 2.14 中需要主动启用；现在所有 nccl 进程组都默认使用它。

14
00:01:26,564 --> 00:01:31,884
The backend changes are marked API unstable.
这些后端改动被标记为 API 不稳定。

15
00:01:31,884 --> 00:01:39,048
Ava: One-sided transfers sound useful when a peer needs data without making every rank join a collective.
Ava：如果某个对等节点需要数据，却不用让所有 rank 都参与集合通信，单边传输听起来很有用。

16
00:01:39,048 --> 00:01:41,690
Is a process group still needed?
还需要进程组吗？

17
00:01:41,690 --> 00:01:48,963
Brian: No. torch.distributed now has a Python transport API, with NIXL as its first backend.
Brian：不用。torch.distributed 现在提供 Python 传输 API，首个后端是 NIXL。

18
00:01:48,963 --> 00:01:51,531
Peers connect through a store.
对等节点通过 store 建立连接。

19
00:01:51,531 --> 00:02:02,320
Transport.read_stream and Transport.write_stream enqueue transfers on a CUDA stream, so torch.cuda.graph can capture them.
Transport.read_stream 和 Transport.write_stream 会把传输操作加入 CUDA stream 队列，因此 torch.cuda.graph 可以捕获它们。

20
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:08,088
Ava: For FSDP2, I can see a mixed-precision issue in an MoE model.
Ava：在 MoE 模型中，我能想到 FSDP2 的一个混合精度问题。

21
00:02:08,088 --> 00:02:16,758
Router gates and norm weights may need fp32, while the rest of the model trains in bf16.
路由门控和归一化权重可能需要 fp32，而模型其余部分用 bf16 训练。

22
00:02:16,758 --> 00:02:24,071
Brian: FSDP2 can keep those selected parameters in fp32 and still use one all-gather per fully_shard.
Brian：FSDP2 可以让选定参数保持 fp32，同时每次 fully_shard 仍只需一次 all-gather。

23
00:02:24,071 --> 00:02:33,639
It also supports per-parameter gradient precision, and a full gradient-accumulation step can be captured in one CUDA graph.
它还支持逐参数设置梯度精度，并能用一张 CUDA graph 捕获完整的梯度累积步骤。

24
00:02:33,639 --> 00:02:41,924
Gradients now accumulate directly in .grad, which changes the default behavior when reduce_dtype=None.
梯度现在直接累积到 .grad 中，这改变了 reduce_dtype=None 时的默认行为。

25
00:02:41,924 --> 00:02:45,499
Ava: Pipeline parallelism has a different memory issue.
Ava：流水线并行还有另一个内存问题。

26
00:02:45,499 --> 00:02:52,721
Receive buffers are now allocated just before each receive, instead of for every microbatch up front.
接收缓冲区现在会在每次接收前才分配，而不是预先为所有微批次分配。

27
00:02:52,721 --> 00:02:56,146
What happens to outputs waiting for a send?
等待发送的输出会怎样？

28
00:02:56,146 --> 00:03:00,341
Brian: Forward outputs are released once their sends finish.
Brian：前向输出在发送完成后就会释放。

29
00:03:00,341 --> 00:03:09,600
A schedule can set a max_outstanding_sends budget, and FSDP unshards are staggered across each rank's startup bubble.
调度策略可设置 max_outstanding_sends 预算，FSDP 的参数解分片也会错开安排在各 rank 的启动空档中。

30
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:13,558
Gradient reduction can overlap subsequent compute.
梯度归约可以与后续计算重叠。

31
00:03:13,558 --> 00:03:20,160
Each unique edge between pipeline ranks also gets a dedicated P2P communicator.
流水线 rank 之间的每条独立连接也都有专用的 P2P 通信器。

32
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:25,884
Ava: For NVFP4 decoding on NVIDIA Blackwell, launch overhead matters.
Ava：在 NVIDIA Blackwell 上进行 NVFP4 解码时，算子启动开销很重要。

33
00:03:25,884 --> 00:03:34,910
A separate pointwise dequantization launch per ModelOpt NVFP4 linear layer adds up across layers.
每个 ModelOpt NVFP4 线性层都单独启动一次逐元素反量化，层数一多，开销就会累积。

34
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:43,099
Brian: NVGEMM folds that layer's scalar dequantization factor into the GEMM, removing the separate launch.
Brian：NVGEMM 将该层的标量反量化因子融入 GEMM，省去了单独启动算子。

35
00:03:43,099 --> 00:03:49,468
It also has a shape-aware candidate policy for Blackwell NVFP4 decode shapes.
它还针对 Blackwell NVFP4 解码的张量形状，采用感知形状的候选方案选择策略。

36
00:03:49,468 --> 00:03:57,676
Programmatic dependent launch can overlap a Triton consumer with the tail of the producer GEMM.
可编程依赖式启动可让 Triton 消费端与生产端 GEMM 的收尾阶段重叠执行。

37
00:03:57,676 --> 00:04:03,100
Ava: Apple Silicon has a measured decode result too.
Ava：Apple Silicon 上也有经过测量的解码性能结果。

38
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:13,722
The new MPS grouped_mm path gives 1.32–1.34x higher MoE decode throughput on an M3 Ultra.
新的 MPS grouped_mm 路径让 M3 Ultra 上的 MoE 解码吞吐量提升至 1.32–1.34 倍。

39
00:04:13,722 --> 00:04:16,665
Brian: That path uses gemv for decode.
Brian：这条路径使用 gemv 进行解码。

40
00:04:16,665 --> 00:04:27,963
Separately, F.linear uses existing gemv kernels, with a 1.23x geometric-mean speedup and up to 5x on small projections.
另外，F.linear 使用现有的 gemv 内核，几何平均加速比为 1.23 倍，在小型投影上最高达 5 倍。

41
00:04:27,963 --> 00:04:31,096
Those are different measurements.
这是两项不同的性能测量。

42
00:04:31,096 --> 00:04:39,800
MPS also supports torch.float8_e4m3fn and _scaled_mm with tensorwise or rowwise scaling.
MPS 还支持 torch.float8_e4m3fn，以及采用逐张量或逐行缩放的 _scaled_mm。

43
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:44,852
Ava: The MPS kernel work goes beyond decode.
Ava：MPS 的内核改进不止于解码。

44
00:04:44,852 --> 00:04:53,272
A single-row softmax over a 128,256-entry vocabulary drops by 8x.
对大小为 128,256 的词表做单行 softmax，耗时降至原来的八分之一。

45
00:04:53,272 --> 00:05:01,654
QR of a 512 x 512 matrix falls from about 7 seconds to 1.5 ms.
对 512 × 512 矩阵做 QR 分解，耗时从约 7 秒降至 1.5 毫秒。

46
00:05:01,654 --> 00:05:18,544
Brian: MPS also gains public stream APIs, including torch.mps.Stream, current_stream, set_stream, a stream context manager, and Tensor.record_stream.
Brian：MPS 还新增了公开的 stream API，包括 torch.mps.Stream、current_stream、set_stream、stream 上下文管理器和 Tensor.record_stream。

47
00:05:18,544 --> 00:05:26,268
For MPS acceleration, PyTorch 2.15 requires macOS 15 or newer.
使用 MPS 加速时，PyTorch 2.15 要求 macOS 15 或更新版本。

48
00:05:26,268 --> 00:05:30,528
Ava: AMD support spans kernel authoring and packaging.
Ava：AMD 支持涵盖内核编写和软件打包。

49
00:05:30,528 --> 00:05:34,442
What do the new gfx targets actually get?
新的 gfx 目标具体获得了哪些支持？

50
00:05:34,442 --> 00:05:50,519
Brian: On gfx950, Inductor autotunes optional FlyDSL templates for GEMM, ragged F.grouped_mm, and MXFP4/MXFP8 scaled_mm alongside Triton and ATen.
Brian：在 gfx950 上，Inductor 会将可选的 FlyDSL 模板与 Triton、ATen 一起纳入自动调优，覆盖 GEMM、处理不规则输入的 F.grouped_mm，以及 MXFP4/MXFP8 scaled_mm。

51
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:53,989
FlyDSL requires version 0.3.x.
FlyDSL 要求使用 0.3.x 版本。

52
00:05:53,989 --> 00:06:12,032
On gfx1250, or MI450, Inductor uses the Tensor Data Mover for dense mm/addmm, pointwise and reduction code generation, and FlexAttention forward and decode.
在 gfx1250（即 MI450）上，Inductor 使用 Tensor Data Mover 为稠密 mm/addmm、逐点运算和归约生成代码，也用于 FlexAttention 的前向计算和解码。

53
00:06:12,032 --> 00:06:17,008
PyTorch 2.15 also adds ROCm 10.0 wheels.
PyTorch 2.15 还新增了 ROCm 10.0 的 wheel 包。

54
00:06:17,008 --> 00:06:21,783
Ava: On Intel GPUs, the change seems useful for kernel authors.
Ava：对 Intel GPU 而言，这项改动似乎对内核开发者很有用。

55
00:06:21,783 --> 00:06:33,246
Free-function SYCL kernels replace more verbose functor-based implementations, and most existing SYCL kernels have moved to that model.
自由函数形式的 SYCL 内核取代了更繁琐的函子实现，大多数现有 SYCL 内核也已迁移到这种形式。

56
00:06:33,246 --> 00:06:48,599
Brian: Profiling now shows kernels in XPU Graph replay, correlates XCCL collectives across ranks, and collects per-kernel hardware counters across Intel GPUs in multi-GPU workloads.
Brian：性能分析现在能显示 XPU Graph 重放中的内核，关联各 rank 的 XCCL 集合通信，并采集多 GPU 工作负载中 Intel GPU 的逐内核硬件计数器。

57
00:06:48,599 --> 00:06:57,332
There's also IPC support for torch.xpu.Event and new allocation policies for torch.xpu.MemPool.
torch.xpu.Event 还新增了 IPC 支持，torch.xpu.MemPool 也有了新的分配策略。

58
00:06:57,332 --> 00:07:01,950
Ava: Compatibility could be the first thing teams feel.
Ava：兼容性可能是团队最先感受到的变化。

59
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:08,139
CUDA 13.2 is the default wheel, with CUDA 13.4 wheels alongside it.
CUDA 13.2 是默认的 wheel 包，同时也提供 CUDA 13.4 的 wheel 包。

60
00:07:08,139 --> 00:07:11,722
Python 3.10 is no longer supported.
Python 3.10 已不再受支持。

61
00:07:11,722 --> 00:07:25,093
Brian: The CUDA 13.4 wheels cover Linux x86_64, Linux aarch64, and Windows, with experimental support for NVIDIA Rubin GPUs.
Brian：CUDA 13.4 的 wheel 包覆盖 Linux x86_64、Linux aarch64 和 Windows，并实验性支持 NVIDIA Rubin GPU。

62
00:07:25,093 --> 00:07:36,407
PyTorch 2.15 supports Python 3.11 through 3.15, including the free-threaded 3.14t and 3.15t builds.
PyTorch 2.15 支持 Python 3.11 至 3.15，包括无 GIL 的 3.14t 和 3.15t 构建版本。

63
00:07:36,407 --> 00:07:41,328
torch.compile also works on Python 3.15.
torch.compile 也能在 Python 3.15 上运行。

64
00:07:41,328 --> 00:07:44,834
Ava: There are two more developer details I'd watch.
Ava：还有两处开发者细节值得留意。

65
00:07:44,834 --> 00:07:50,951
CUDA graph profiling can now link replayed kernels to the code that captured them.
CUDA 图性能分析现在能将重放的内核关联到捕获它们的代码。

66
00:07:50,951 --> 00:07:58,910
Extensions also get a compile-time error if TORCH_TARGET_VERSION is newer than their libtorch headers.
如果 TORCH_TARGET_VERSION 高于扩展所用的 libtorch 头文件版本，编译时也会报错。

67
00:07:58,910 --> 00:08:04,004
Brian: The profiling path uses CUPTI node-creation callbacks.
Brian：这项性能分析功能使用 CUPTI 节点创建回调。

68
00:08:04,004 --> 00:08:11,645
With record_py_stacks, CUDA graphs capture the Python launch stack for each node.
启用 record_py_stacks 后，CUDA 图会为每个节点捕获 Python 启动调用栈。

69
00:08:11,645 --> 00:08:15,580
The CUPTI monitor is now called Cuspy.
CUPTI 监控器现在叫 Cuspy。

70
00:08:15,580 --> 00:08:29,466
Ava: The practical takeaway is to check your NCCL path and version requirements, then focus on the changes that match your workload: distributed scheduling, low-precision decode, or GPU kernel tooling.
Ava：实际使用时，先检查 NCCL 路径和版本要求，再关注与你的工作负载相关的变化：分布式调度、低精度解码或 GPU 内核工具。

71
00:08:29,466 --> 00:08:39,091
Brian: There's a PyTorch 2.15 Q&A webinar on Thursday, November 5, 2026, at 11 AM PT.
Brian：2026 年 11 月 5 日星期四，太平洋时间上午 11 点将举办 PyTorch 2.15 问答网络研讨会。

72
00:08:39,091 --> 00:08:42,032
Thanks for listening.
感谢收听。
